{
    "version": 21,
    "variables": [],
    "tiles": {
        "0": {
            "type": "markdown",
            "content": "## Calculator Reliability Dashboard\n\nGoogle SRE-style 30-day SLO view for the Calculator frontend. This dashboard tracks separate SLIs for availability, errors, and latency, then treats the weakest one as the composite reliability guardrail.\n\n| SLI | Source | Objective |\n|-----|--------|-----------|\n| Availability | Synthetic browser tests | 99.95% |\n| Error-free interactions | RUM frontend errors vs requests | 99.5% |\n| Latency proxy | RUM p75 LCP against 2.5s target | 95% |"
        },
        "1": {
            "title": "Active problems (30d)",
            "type": "data",
            "query": "fetch dt.davis.problems, from: now()-30d\n| expand affected_entity_ids\n| filter affected_entity_ids == \"APPLICATION-D9224DBD5E818C72\" or affected_entity_ids == \"SYNTHETIC_TEST-5EC0C08020E249C7\" or affected_entity_ids == \"SYNTHETIC_TEST-4E92A5075C3A306C\"\n| filter event.status == \"ACTIVE\"\n| summarize count = countDistinct(display_id)",
            "visualization": "singleValue",
            "visualizationSettings": {
                "singleValue": {
                    "label": "Active problems",
                    "isIconVisible": true,
                    "prefixIcon": "WarningIcon"
                },
                "coloring": {
                    "colorRules": [
                        {
                            "value": 3,
                            "comparator": "≤",
                            "field": "count",
                            "colorMode": "custom-color",
                            "customColor": {
                                "Default": "var(--dt-colors-charts-apdex-unacceptable-default, #cd3741)"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "value": 1,
                            "comparator": "≤",
                            "field": "count",
                            "colorMode": "custom-color",
                            "customColor": {
                                "Default": "var(--dt-colors-charts-apdex-fair-default, #a9780f)"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "value": 0,
                            "comparator": "≤",
                            "field": "count",
                            "colorMode": "custom-color",
                            "customColor": {
                                "Default": "var(--dt-colors-charts-status-ideal-default, #2f6862)"
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "autoSelectVisualization": false
            },
            "querySettings": {
                "maxResultRecords": 1000,
                "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
                "maxResultMegaBytes": 1,
                "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
                "enableSampling": false
            },
            "davis": {
                "enabled": false,
                "davisVisualization": {
                    "isAvailable": true
                }
            }
        },
        "2": {
            "title": "Synthetic tests monitored",
            "type": "data",
