        "6": {
            "type": "markdown",
            "content": "**Operational guidance**\n- Active problems should be 0\n- Synthetic monitors should run every 60s\n- Investigate gaps in last run time\n- Confirm the detected URL matches production"
        },
        "7": {
            "type": "markdown",
            "content": "**Composite SLO model**\n- Keep availability, errors, and latency as separate SLIs\n- Compute the composite as the lowest-attaining SLI\n- Track remaining budget separately from raw SLI attainment\n- Alert on burn rate, not on fixed red or amber thresholds"
        },
        "8": {
            "title": "Failure trend (problems) - 30d",
            "type": "data",
            "query": "fetch dt.davis.problems, from: now()-30d\n| expand affected_entity_ids\n| filter affected_entity_ids == \"APPLICATION-D9224DBD5E818C72\" or affected_entity_ids == \"SYNTHETIC_TEST-5EC0C08020E249C7\" or affected_entity_ids == \"SYNTHETIC_TEST-4E92A5075C3A306C\"\n| dedup display_id\n| makeTimeseries time:event.start, { problems = count() }",
            "visualization": "lineChart",
            "visualizationSettings": {
                "autoSelectVisualization": true
            },
            "querySettings": {
                "maxResultRecords": 1000,
                "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
                "maxResultMegaBytes": 2,
                "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
                "enableSampling": false
            },
            "davis": {
                "enabled": false,
                "davisVisualization": {
